  "prefLabel": "Env-A 102.02 Acid rain affected source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 102.02 “Acid rain affected source” means a source that includes one or more acid rain affected units.\n\nSource. #6057-A, eff 6-30-95; ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.03) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
